                        "entry_id": "8c7c7768-7029-3767-a2a4-faccb75283af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something that resembles the Pokémon Jigglypuff, e.g. by being rotund, bright pink, or able to induce sleep."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af96006c-5a5b-4b5d-9777-4526cfc19c26",
                                "sense_id": "2e9b31c4-0d69-3011-8a7c-90ec23ffe88f",
                                "text": "When they pointed out that I'd have to pay a couple of hundred bucks if I ever rejoined, I just laughed at them, pressed my fingertips to my temples, and visualized about seven and a half pounds off my jigglypuff thighs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e12f49b1-aafe-4f76-8678-48b2cd04abd4",
                                "sense_id": "2e9b31c4-0d69-3011-8a7c-90ec23ffe88f",
                                "text": "They sleep when you on the mic, you're fucking Jigglypuff"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77bc93fb-c06c-4a54-b032-dcdeb8014a11",
                                "sense_id": "2e9b31c4-0d69-3011-8a7c-90ec23ffe88f",
                                "text": "And when your body type is \"Kirby\" or \"Jigglypuff\", finding a style that is meant for your shape is next to impossible."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
